OMPT (fresh input + cache read + cache write; for OpenAI the input tokens including cached) is larger than thresholdTokens; each request is priced on its own. Data-residency 1.1x (inference_geo) and OpenAI Flex/Priority tiers are not visible in the logs and are not modelled.",
